<h2 id="colophon">Colophon</h2>
<p><em>This question has been asked frequently since Org was created.  This page is intended to become a comprehensive resource that can be shared when the question is asked.  Please feel free to add relevant blog articles to the “Articles” section, and relevant discussions to the “Discussions” one.  When adding content, please follow the patterns established in each section.</em></p>
